      "content": "thanks. it's a good start but i think the density score might come back a bit low for what my supervisor expects. it feels a little too concise. could you expand on this and make it a more \"deep-dive\" style brief? try to integrate more of the specific biochemical mechanisms and technical parameters mentioned or implied in the study to ensure we hit that technical threshold, but again, just make sure it stays scientifically coherent and actually explains the process well.",
